{"seq":1,"slug":"shared-config-conventions","title":"共享配置与约定：ESLint/TSConfig/Prettier 跨包统一","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-monorepo-tooling/code-quality/shared-config-conventions","wordCount":712,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"共享配置与约定-eslint-tsconfig-prettier-跨包统一\">共享配置与约定：ESLint/TSConfig/Prettier 跨包统一</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>术语</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>共享配置包</td>\n<td>将 ESLint/TSConfig/Prettier 配置封装为内部包，供所有项目继承</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>配置继承</td>\n<td>TypeScript 的 <code>extends</code> 和 ESLint 的 <code>extends</code> 机制，实现配置复用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>flat config</td>\n<td>ESLint v9 引入的新配置格式（<code>eslint.config.js</code>），替代 <code>.eslintrc.*</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>workspace:*</code></td>\n<td>pnpm 的工作区协议，用于引用本地共享配置包</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>.editorconfig</code></td>\n<td>跨编辑器的基础格式规则配置文件，优先级低于 Prettier</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>配置漂移</td>\n<td>各包独立维护配置导致规则不一致的问题</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"为什么需要共享配置\">为什么需要共享配置</h2><p>在 Monorepo 中，如果每个包独立维护 ESLint、TypeScript 和 Prettier 配置，会带来以下问题：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>规则不一致</strong>：不同包的 lint 规则版本不同，代码风格出现差异</li>\n<li><strong>升级成本高</strong>：每次升级 ESLint 插件需要在所有包中重复操作</li>\n<li><strong>配置膨胀</strong>：每个包目录下都有重复的配置文件，增加维护负担</li>\n<li><strong>审查困难</strong>：没有单一真相源，难以了解当前生效的规则全集</li>\n</ul>\n<p>共享配置的解决方案是：<strong>将配置提取为专用内部包，其他包通过 <code>extends</code>/<code>workspace:*</code> 引用</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    tooling_tsconfig[&quot;tooling/tsconfig\\n(共享 TSConfig)&quot;]&#10;    tooling_eslint[&quot;tooling/eslint-config\\n(共享 ESLint)&quot;]&#10;    tooling_prettier[&quot;tooling/prettier-config\\n(共享 Prettier)&quot;]&#10;&#10;    tooling_tsconfig --&gt; packages_utils[&quot;packages/utils&quot;]&#10;    tooling_tsconfig --&gt; packages_ui[&quot;packages/ui&quot;]&#10;    tooling_tsconfig --&gt; apps_web[&quot;apps/web&quot;]&#10;&#10;    tooling_eslint --&gt; packages_utils&#10;    tooling_eslint --&gt; packages_ui&#10;    tooling_eslint --&gt; apps_web&#10;&#10;    tooling_prettier --&gt; packages_utils&#10;    tooling_prettier --&gt; packages_ui&#10;    tooling_prettier --&gt; apps_web\">graph TD\n    tooling_tsconfig[\"tooling/tsconfig\\n(共享 TSConfig)\"]\n    tooling_eslint[\"tooling/eslint-config\\n(共享 ESLint)\"]\n    tooling_prettier[\"tooling/prettier-config\\n(共享 Prettier)\"]\n\n    tooling_tsconfig --&gt; packages_utils[\"packages/utils\"]\n    tooling_tsconfig --&gt; packages_ui[\"packages/ui\"]\n    tooling_tsconfig --&gt; apps_web[\"apps/web\"]\n\n    tooling_eslint --&gt; packages_utils\n    tooling_eslint --&gt; packages_ui\n    tooling_eslint --&gt; apps_web\n\n    tooling_prettier --&gt; packages_utils\n    tooling_prettier --&gt; packages_ui\n    tooling_prettier --&gt; apps_web</pre><h2 id=\"共享-tsconfig-体系\">共享 TSConfig 体系</h2><h3 id=\"基础-tsconfig-包\">基础 TSConfig 包</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"tooling/tsconfig/&#10;├── package.json&#10;├── base.json          # 所有包共用的基础配置&#10;├── react-library.json # React 组件库配置（继承 base）&#10;├── nextjs.json        # Next.js 应用配置（继承 base）&#10;└── node.json          # Node.js 服务配置（继承 base）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>tooling/tsconfig/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── package.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── base.json          # 所有包共用的基础配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── react-library.json # React 组件库配置（继承 base）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── nextjs.json        # Next.js 应用配置（继承 base）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── node.json          # Node.js 服务配置（继承 base）</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>tooling/tsconfig/package.json</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;@myorg/tsconfig&quot;,&#10;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;0.0.0&quot;,&#10;  &quot;private&quot;: true,&#10;  &quot;exports&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;./base&quot;: &quot;./base.json&quot;,&#10;    &quot;./react-library&quot;: &quot;./react-library.json&quot;,&#10;    &quot;./nextjs&quot;: &quot;./nextjs.json&quot;,&#10;    &quot;./node&quot;: &quot;./node.json&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"@myorg/tsconfig\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"0.0.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"private\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"exports\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"./base\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./base.json\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"./react-library\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./react-library.json\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"./nextjs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./nextjs.json\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"./node\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./node.json\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>tooling/tsconfig/base.json</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;$schema&quot;: &quot;https://json.schemastore.org/tsconfig&quot;,&#10;  &quot;compilerOptions&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;strict&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;noUncheckedIndexedAccess&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;esModuleInterop&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;skipLibCheck&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;forceConsistentCasingInFileNames&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;moduleResolution&quot;: &quot;bundler&quot;,&#10;    &quot;module&quot;: &quot;ESNext&quot;,&#10;    &quot;target&quot;: &quot;ES2022&quot;,&#10;    &quot;lib&quot;: [&quot;ES2022&quot;],&#10;    &quot;declaration&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;declarationMap&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;sourceMap&quot;: true&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"$schema\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://json.schemastore.org/tsconfig\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"compilerOptions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"strict\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"noUncheckedIndexedAccess\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"esModuleInterop\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"skipLibCheck\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"forceConsistentCasingInFileNames\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"moduleResolution\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"bundler\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"module\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ESNext\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"target\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ES2022\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"lib\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ES2022\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"declaration\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"declarationMap\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"sourceMap\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>tooling/tsconfig/react-library.json</code>（继承 base）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;$schema&quot;: &quot;https://json.schemastore.org/tsconfig&quot;,&#10;  &quot;extends&quot;: &quot;./base.json&quot;,&#10;  &quot;compilerOptions&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;jsx&quot;: &quot;react-jsx&quot;,&#10;    &quot;lib&quot;: [&quot;ES2022&quot;, &quot;DOM&quot;, &quot;DOM.Iterable&quot;]&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"$schema\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://json.schemastore.org/tsconfig\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"extends\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./base.json\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"compilerOptions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"jsx\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"react-jsx\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<spa